sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant API as eval-hub API<br/>8080/TCP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Init as eval-runtime-init<br/>(init container)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Provider Adapter
    participant Sidecar as eval-runtime-sidecar
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Client,MLflow: Flow 1: Evaluation Job Execution

    Client->>KRBP: POST /api/v1/evaluations/jobs<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBP->>API: Forward request<br/>X-User + X-Tenant headers
    API->>DB: INSERT evaluation record<br/>tenant_id scoped
    DB-->>API: Row created
    API->>K8s: Create Job<br/>ServiceAccount auth
    K8s-->>API: Job accepted
    API-->>KRBP: 201 Created
    KRBP-->>Client: Evaluation Job ID

    Note over Init,S3: Job Pod starts — init container runs first

    Init->>S3: Download test data<br/>AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>Init: Test data artifacts

    Note over Adapter,MLflow: Adapter runs evaluation with sidecar proxy

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Inference request<br/>HTTP (pod-local, no TLS)
    Sidecar->>Model: Forward to model<br/>HTTPS + TLS
    Model-->>Sidecar: Inference response
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: Proxied response

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Log results<br/>HTTP (pod-local)
    Sidecar->>MLflow: Track experiment<br/>HTTPS + SA token + CA bundle
    MLflow-->>Sidecar: Tracking confirmed
    Sidecar-->>Adapter: OK

    Adapter->>Sidecar: Report completion<br/>HTTP (pod-local)
    Sidecar->>API: PUT /api/v1/evaluations/jobs/{id}<br/>HTTPS + SA token
    API->>DB: UPDATE evaluation status
    API-->>Sidecar: OK

    Note over Client,MLflow: Flow 2: MCP Agent Interaction

    participant MCPClient as MCP Client
    participant MCP as evalhub-mcp<br/>3001/TCP

    MCPClient->>KRBP: POST / (MCP Streamable HTTP)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    KRBP->>MCP: Forward request<br/>Forwarded identity
    MCP->>KRBP: REST API call to eval-hub<br/>EVALHUB_TOKEN
    KRBP->>API: Forward request<br/>X-User + X-Tenant
    API-->>KRBP: API response
    KRBP-->>MCP: Response
    MCP-->>KRBP: MCP tool result
    KRBP-->>MCPClient: MCP response

    Note over Client,MLflow: Flow 3: Prometheus Metrics Scrape

    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Prom->>API: GET /metrics<br/>8081/TCP HTTP<br/>No auth (separate port)
    API-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
